<title>CHILE: Chile's CTC Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Chile's CTC Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA reported the following earnings in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>		    Q1 1997	   Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit	36.67   profit  27.93</p>
<p>Oper profit     31.40   profit  29.10</p>
<p>Non-oper profit  5.79     loss   1.13</p>
<p>Total revenues 101.84		91.60</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos. ((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
</text>
